#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-using-vagrant.rst:11
#: 872e5e781e6244f9b07b08f83d79c326
msgid ""
"This article explains how to set up the :ref:`SITL ArduPilot Simulator "
"<sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop>` in a virtual machine environment "
"using `Vagrant <https://www.vagrantup.com/>`__, and connect it to a "
"Ground Control Station running on the host computer. This approach is "
"much easier and faster than :ref:`manually <setting-up-sitl-on-windows>` "
"setting up a virtual machine to run SITL on Mac OSX or Windows (or "
"Linux)."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何使用 `Vagrant <https://www.vagrantup.com/>`__ 在虚拟机环境中设置 :ref:`SITL "
"ArduPilot 仿真器 <sitl-simulator-software-in-the-"
"loop>`，并将其连接到运行在主机上的地面控制站。这种方式比在 Mac OSX 或 Windows（或 Linux）上 :ref:`手动 "
"<setting-up-sitl-on-windows>` 设置虚拟机以运行 SITL 要简单和快速得多。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-using-vagrant.rst:19
#: 4d45e21f3fa247f5a8e8a766a1f7aef1
msgid "These instructions have been tested on Windows 8.1."
msgstr "这些说明已在 Windows 8.1 上测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-using-vagrant.rst:22
#: 25aebac9f66d4cc4aa41771f55afe3ce
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-using-vagrant.rst:24
#: 77d7730d8ebd41f181bea7331b845519
msgid ""
"The SITL (Software In The Loop) simulator allows you to run Plane, Copter"
" or Rover without any hardware. The simulator runs the normal ArduPilot "
"code as a native executable on a Linux PC. SITL can also be run within a "
"virtual machine on Windows, Mac OSX or Linux."
msgstr ""
"SITL（软件在环）仿真器允许您在无需任何硬件的情况下运行 Plane、Copter 或 Rover。该仿真器将正常的 ArduPilot "
"代码作为本地可执行文件在 Linux PC 上运行。SITL 也可以在 Windows、Mac OSX 或 Linux 上的虚拟机中运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-using-vagrant.rst:29
#: d2a3db77368f49aa86a6c364dbb08d99
msgid ""
"Vagrant is a tool for automating setting up and configuring development "
"environments running in virtual machines. While it is possible to "
":ref:`manually set up SITL to run in a VM on Windows <setting-up-sitl-on-"
"windows>` (or Mac OSX), it is **much easier** (and more reproducible) to "
"use Vagrant to do this work for you."
msgstr ""
"Vagrant 是一个用于自动化设置和配置运行在虚拟机中的开发环境的工具。虽然可以 :ref:`手动设置 SITL 在 Windows（或 Mac"
" OSX）的虚拟机中运行 <setting-up-sitl-on-windows>`，但使用 Vagrant 来完成这些工作要 **简单得多** "
"（也更具可重现性）。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-using-vagrant.rst:37
#: 9e71ca6786874c49b1f6015b738c410e
msgid ""
"Due to the way submodules are currently handled in the build system, it "
"is not possible to have a repository which can be built on both the host "
"and virtual machines.  A dedicated repository should be used for running "
"the Vagrant virtual machine."
msgstr "由于构建系统目前处理子模块的方式，无法使用一个仓库在主机和虚拟机上同时进行构建。应使用专用仓库来运行 Vagrant 虚拟机。"

